BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (Lindqvist-Hart, chief technology officer, is a senior in computer science and built the) Tj T* (application, including its local storage and sync logic. Daniela Whitcombe, head of operations,) Tj T* (is a junior in accounting who designed the tax estimation logic and the end-of-day report. All) Tj T* (three founders are full-time students and work on Ledgerleaf alongside their coursework,) Tj T* (averaging about 15 hours per week each.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (To date we have defined the core concept, registered the business name, built a working version) Tj T* (of the application, and launched a website describing the product. Twelve vendors are using the) Tj T* (product in a free trial, and one vendor, a honey and preserves seller, has paid for a) Tj T* (subscription at $9 per month. Total revenue to date is $27. Our spending to date is) Tj T* (approximately $640, funded personally by the founders, covering website hosting, a developer) Tj T* (account for app distribution, and printed signage. We have not yet formed a legal entity for) Tj T* (the venture and operate informally; incorporation is an early use of any funds we receive. Over) Tj T* (the next twelve months we project reaching 100 paying vendors, though this depends on) Tj T* (conversion from trial users, which we have not yet observed at scale. Our principal costs would) Tj T* (be part-time contract development, app store fees, and travel to markets, which we estimate at) Tj T* ($18,000 for the year.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Ask For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are requesting $15,000 in competition funding. We would allocate $4,000 to legal formation) Tj T* (and basic accounting setup, $6,500 to expanding the pilot to ten markets including vendor) Tj T* (onboarding visits, $3,500 to contract development for card payment integration, and $1,000 to a) Tj T* (vendor survey to better measure willingness to pay and acquisition cost. Beyond funding, we) Tj T* (would value mentorship on pricing, on how to approach market associations, and on whether a) Tj T* (subscription model is appropriate for vendors with highly seasonal income. Our goal at the end) Tj T* (of the funding period is to demonstrate paid retention across several markets and to determine) Tj T* (whether the business can reach sustainable revenue.) Tj ET
endstream
